      "assessment": "Full body read in contiguous chunks. Meaningful finite constructor/range/type/arity/zero-support controls, rational 1/3,2/3 renormalization, discontinuous path and divergent join failures, reversal and protected-pair projection examples. Information cohomology nilpotence is a method Boolean on supplied coefficients; no coboundary matrix is instantiated. Quarantine isolation is string-name checking; purported mutant is an unrelated lambda plus assertion of known False. Genesis apparatus set is constructed in test itself; pin is literal equality. Tower exhausts both singleton relations but only compares pinned strings for two-element stages, not the claimed16-relation computation. AST exactness uses caller-supplied zero residuals. CitationAnchor verified=True and Lean bridge PASS/hash/theorem names are supplied metadata, no source-byte/Lean verification. Native-refusal preservation test only counts three literal codes (F011). Sovereignty arithmetic99-56 gives43 but refusal label supplied. LP fixture is sound optimum5 for |3-a|+|2+a|, with five useful inconsistent certificate mutants; several mutants violate multiple conditions so do not isolate individual checks. RationalDualityGap equality alone has no primal/dual feasibility premise. Protocol isinstance tests only method presence on mocks (including always-True Lean verifier), not correct signatures, implementations, architecture or kernel proof. No module imports/native execution.",
