      "assessment": "Full installed probe read in bounded chunks. It combines import/export and packaged-resource checks, synthetic typed CLI handoffs, ten source-bound historical challenge starts, a C054 dual-checker fixture/empty-answer control, matrix CLI help, fake-transport budget refusal, explicit native budget calls, HMAC custody and SQLite signed-tip delivery controls. Synthetic provenance and no model evidence are stated; no probe was executed by this audit because it imports broad external owners and invokes a supplied native executable. Arithmetic acceptance uses an independent 17*-9 predicate, while schema-only CLI controls intentionally accept a wrong integer as unverified. End-of-run module-origin predicate has an empty startswith prefix and therefore selects all modules, including allowed standard-library dependencies outside the installed target; see F001/C002. Positive labels are contingent on all assertions and supplied runtime, not a general PFP theorem.",
